  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Papua New Guinea Economic Resilience Support Package</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A package of support to work&#xa0;alongside Australia and the ADB to provide budget support and/or reform assistance to the SOE sector in Papua New Guinea. Support can include, but is not limited to, financial support and/or technical assistance. The Activity will also support small-scale projects with a focus on strengthening PNG&apos;s economic resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
